<title>BELGIUM: EU/Boeing make progress on one issue-EU source.</title>
<headline>EU/Boeing make progress on one issue-EU source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission and Boeing have made progress on one issue in their discussions on the aircraft manufacturer's planned merger with McDonnell-Douglas, an EU source said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Some progress has been made on one of the issues,&quot; the source said, but more progress needed to be made before the EU could clear the deal.</p>
</text>
